# Hand animation phases (docs/design/held-and-world-items.md phase C). A
# successful primary press swings (6 ticks, data/hands.toml), a successful
# secondary press uses (4 ticks); the phase rises to 1 halfway and returns to 0.
# A frame of 50 ms is one sim tick.

case a sword swing runs its phase tick by tick and returns to 0
start walk raft
click
lock
spawn animal cow
held tool:sword
face animal
frame 50 x2
expect rule.primary = attack
expect hands.swing = 0
button down left
frame 50
button up left
expect hands.swing ~ 0.3333
frame 50
expect hands.swing ~ 0.6667
frame 50
expect hands.swing ~ 1
frame 50
expect hands.swing ~ 0.6667
frame 50
expect hands.swing ~ 0.3333
frame 50
expect hands.swing = 0
frame 50
expect hands.swing = 0
expect hands.use = 0

case a hoe use runs its phase tick by tick and returns to 0
start walk raft
click
lock
press Backquote
type give tool hoe
press Enter
frame 50 x2
lock
stand field
expect rule.secondary = till
expect hands.use = 0
button down right
frame 50
button up right
expect hands.use ~ 0.5
frame 50
expect hands.use ~ 1
frame 50
expect hands.use ~ 0.5
frame 50
expect hands.use = 0
expect hands.swing = 0
